  "content": "\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/city-craft\"><img src=\"http://cf.way2muchnoise.eu/short_985069.svg?badge_style=flat\" alt=\"CurseForge\"></a> \n  <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/rexs-city-craft\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/modrinth/dt/rexs-city-craft?logo=modrinth&label=&suffix=%20&style=flat&color=242629&labelColor=5ca424&logoColor=1c1c1c\" alt=\"Modrinth\"></a>\n  <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/city-craft\"><img src=\"https://cf.way2muchnoise.eu/versions/985069(266fff).svg?badge_style=flat\" alt=\"支持版本\"></a>\n  <a href=\"https://discord.gg/ycRJJk8EXV\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/523112426913267713?color=282828&logo=discord&style=flat&label=&labelColor=B6BCEA\" alt=\"Discord\"></a>\n</p>\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <img src=\"https://github.com/XxRexRaptorxX/CityCraft/blob/master/src/main/resources/logo.png?raw=true\" alt=\"标志\" width=\"400\"/><br>\n  <img src=\"https://github.com/XxRexRaptorxX/General/blob/main/page_decorations/line_curved.png?raw=true\" alt=\"线条\" width=\"2000\"/>\n</p>\n\n\n## 📖 简介\n\n本模组为游戏增添了与原版兼容的街道、路标及其他装饰方块，让你的世界变身为一座庞大的城市！\n\n-----\n\n### 特色：\n\n- 与科技类模组高度兼容\n- 大量不同的道路方块\n- 来自世界各地的路标、交通护栏、排水井盖等\n- 额外装饰方块（如墙壁、栅栏、灯柱等！）\n- 交通信号灯、路灯和灯笼\n- 在沥青路面上移动速度提升\n- 兼容原版与生存模式\n- 部分方块使用原版纹理制作，可兼容材质包！\n- 发光纹理\n- 连接纹理\n- 版本检测器\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <img src=\"https://github.com/XxRexRaptorxX/General/blob/main/page_decorations/line.png?raw=true\" alt=\"线条\" width=\"2000\"/>\n</p>\n\n## 📷 展示\n\n![街道](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/94iqI5Ec/images/c71b6af7af76f7f8d6cef8a7a7f82134ba40503c.png)\n\n![城市](https://github.com/XxRexRaptorxX/General/blob/main/2024-03-22_16.38.21.png?raw=true)\n\n![道路方块](https://github.com/XxRexRaptorxX/General/blob/main/2024-03-15_15.04.48.png?raw=true)\n\n![路标](https://github.com/XxRexRaptorxX/General/blob/main/2024-03-24_23.05.25.png?raw=true)\n\n![路标](https://github.com/XxRexRaptorxX/General/blob/main/2024-07-02_19.08.43.png?raw=true)\n\n![墙壁与交通护栏](https://github.com/XxRexRaptorxX/General/blob/main/2024-07-02_19.08.33.png?raw=true)\n\n![交通信号灯](https://github.com/XxRexRaptorxX/General/blob/main/2024-07-02_19.08.58.png?raw=true)\n\n![混凝土方块](https://github.com/XxRexRaptorxX/General/blob/main/2025-09-17_21.53.16.png?raw=true)\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <img src=\"https://github.com/XxRexRaptorxX/General/blob/main/page_decorations/line.png?raw=true\" alt=\"线条\" width=\"2000\"/>\n</p>\n\n## 🗃️ 依赖项\n\n### 支持：\n- **The Lost Cities** [≥ MC 1.21]\n  - 使用新的 CityCraft 方块生成城市\n  - [CurseForge][cf_lc] | [Modrinth][mr_lc]\n- **Immersive Engineering**\n    - 额外合成配方\n    - [CurseForge][cf_ie] | [Modrinth][mr_ie]\n- **Mekanism**\n    - 额外合成配方\n    - [CurseForge][cf_mek] | [Modrinth][mr_mek]\n- **Just Enough Items (JEI)**\n    - 提供额外的信息页面并显示所有配方\n    - [CurseForge][cf_jei] | [Modrinth][mr_jei]\n- **Continuity**\n    - 启用模组的发光与连接纹理\n    - [CurseForge][cf_continuity] | [Modrinth][mr_continuity]\n- **MoreMcmeta Emissive Textures**\n    - 启用模组的发光纹理\n    - [CurseForge][cf_mcmeta] | [Modrinth][mr_mcmeta]\n- **Shimmer** [≥ MC 1.21]\n    - 启用彩色闪电\n    - [CurseForge][cf_shimmer] | [Modrinth][mr_shimmer]\n- **Just Enough Effect Descriptions (JEED)**\n    - 在 JEI 中提供状态效果描述\n    - [CurseForge][cf_jeed] | [Modrinth][mr_jeed]\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <img src=\"https://github.com/XxRexRaptorxX/General/blob/main/page_decorations/line.png?raw=true\" alt=\"线条\" width=\"2000\"/>\n</p>\n\n## 🎮 我的其他模组！\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/additional-structures\"><img src=\"https://github.com/XxRexRaptorxX/Additional-Structures/blob/master/src/main/resources/logo.png?raw=true\" alt=\"额外结构\" width=\"85\"/></a>\n  <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/bedrock-miner\"><img src=\"https://github.com/XxRexRaptorxX/Bedrock-Miner/blob/main/src/main/resources/logo.png?raw=true\" alt=\"基岩矿工\" width=\"85\"/></a>\n  <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/tool-upgrades\"><img src=\"https://github.com/XxRexRaptorxX/ToolUpgrades/blob/main/src/main/resources/logo.png?raw=true\" alt=\"工具升级\" width=\"85\"/></a>\n  <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/all-the-compatibility\"><img src=\"https://github.com/XxRexRaptorxX/AllTheCompatibility/blob/main/src/main/resources/logo.png?raw=true\" alt=\"全兼容性\" width=\"85\"/></a>\n  <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/customized-dungeon-loot\"><img src=\"https://camo.githubusercontent.com/2291f5f13114f09294ce5e079f8a61b8a2617a8692e68ca453674e93f1982b62/687474703a2f2f692e696d6775722e636f6d2f427065525748442e706e67\" alt=\"自定义地牢战利品\" width=\"85\"/></a>\n  <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/advanced-sticks\"><img src=\"https://github.com/XxRexRaptorxX/AdvancedSticks/blob/master/src/main/resources/logo.png?raw=true\" alt=\"高级工具\" width=\"85\"/></a>\n  <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/age-of-weapons\"><img src=\"https://camo.githubusercontent.com/e8e1315b08a3bd1fb144ccd47488b1df4033418ad3aee01e61cc9d6e83fa55a5/68747470733a2f2f692e696d6775722e636f6d2f586d324332576a2e706e67\" alt=\"武器时代\" width=\"85\"/></a>\n  <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/rune-craft\"><img src=\"https://github.com/XxRexRaptorxX/RuneCraft/blob/main/src/main/resources/logo.png?raw=true\" alt=\"符文工艺\" width=\"85\"/></a>\n  <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/collectibles\"><img src=\"https://github.com/XxRexRaptorxX/Collectibles/blob/main/src/main/resources/logo.png?raw=true\" alt=\"收藏品\" width=\"85\"/></a> <br> \n  <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/extra-gems\"><img src=\"https://github.com/XxRexRaptorxX/ExtraGems/blob/main/src/main/resources/logo.png?raw=true\" alt=\"额外宝石\" width=\"85\"/></a>\n  <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/minetraps\"><img src=\"https://github.com/XxRexRaptorxX/MineTraps/blob/main/src/main/resources/logo.png?raw=true\" alt=\"挖矿陷阱\" width=\"85\"/></a>\n  <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/exo-craft\"><img src=\"https://github.com/XxRexRaptorxX/ExoCraft/blob/main/src/main/resources/logo.png?raw=true\" alt=\"外骨骼工艺\" width=\"85\"/></a>\n  <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/city-craft\"><img src=\"https://github.com/XxRexRaptorxX/CityCraft/blob/master/src/main/resources/logo.png?raw=true\" alt=\"城市工艺\" width=\"85\"/></a>\n  <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/upcycle\"><img src=\"https://github.com/XxRexRaptorxX/Upcycle/blob/main/src/main/resources/logo.png?raw=true\" alt=\"循环利用\" width=\"85\"/></a>\n  <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/lexicon\"><img src=\"https://github.com/XxRexRaptorxX/Lexicon/blob/main/src/main/resources/logo.png?raw=true\" alt=\"知识百科\" width=\"85\"/></a>\n  <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/nexus-battle-mode\"><img src=\"https://github.com/XxRexRaptorxX/Nexus/blob/master/src/main/resources/logo.png?raw=true\" alt=\"枢纽战斗模式\" width=\"85\"/></a>\n  <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/block-detective\"><img src=\"https://github.com/XxRexRaptorxX/BlockDetective/blob/main/src/main/resources/logo.png?raw=true\" alt=\"方块侦探\" width=\"85\"/></a>\n  <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/suspicious-pots\"><img src=\"https://github.com/XxRexRaptorxX/Suspicious-Pots/blob/main/src/main/resources/logo.png?raw=true\" alt=\"可疑花盆\" width=\"85\"/></a>\n</p>\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <img src=\"https://github.com/XxRexRaptorxX/General/blob/main/page_decorations/line.png?raw=true\" alt=\"线条\" width=\"2000\"/>\n</p>\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n<br>\n  <a href=\"https://discord.com/invite/ycRJJk8EXV\"><img src=\"https://github.com/XxRexRaptorxX/General/blob/main/page_decorations/message.png?raw=true\" alt=\"消息\"/></a>\n</p>\n\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <a href=\"https://github.com/XxRexRaptorxX\"><img src=\"https://github.com/XxRexRaptorxX/General/blob/main/icons/github_icon_bg.png?raw=true\" alt=\"GitHub\" width=\"70\"/></a>\n  <a href=\"https://ko-fi.com/xxrexraptorxx\"><img src=\"https://github.com/XxRexRaptorxX/General/blob/main/icons/kofi_icon_bg.png?raw=true\" alt=\"Ko-fi\" width=\"70\"/></a>\n  <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/bePatron?u=75131568\"><img src=\"https://github.com/XxRexRaptorxX/General/blob/main/icons/patreon_icon_bg.png?raw=true\" alt=\"Patreon\" width=\"70\"/></a>\n  <a href=\"https://discord.com/invite/ycRJJk8EXV\"><img src=\"https://github.com/XxRexRaptorxX/General/blob/main/icons/discord_icon_bg.png?raw=true\" alt=\"Discord\" width=\"70\"/></a>\n  <a href=\"https://x.com/XxRexRaptorxX\"><img src=\"https://github.com/XxRexRaptorxX/General/blob/main/icons/xtwitter_icon_bg.png?raw=true\" alt=\"X\" width=\"70\"/></a>\n  <a href=\"https://github.com/XxRexRaptorxX/General/blob/main/FAQ.md\"><img src=\"https://github.com/XxRexRaptorxX/General/blob/main/icons/wikipedia_icon_bg.png?raw=true\" alt=\"常见问题\" width=\"70\"/></a>\n<br> <br>\n  <a href=\"https://bisecthosting.com/REXRAPTOR\"><img src=\"https://github.com/XxRexRaptorxX/General/blob/main/BH_REX_Bisect.png?raw=true\" alt=\"Bisect Hosting - 使用代码 REXRAPTOR 享 25% 折扣\"/></a>\n</p>\n\n[cf_jei]: https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/jei\n[mr_jei]: https://modrinth.com/mod/jei\n[cf_mcmeta]: https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/moremcmeta-emissive-forge\n[mr_mcmeta]: https://modrinth.com/mod/moremcmeta-emissive\n[cf_continuity]: https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/continuity\n[mr_continuity]: https://modrinth.com/mod/continuity\n[cf_jeed]: https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/just-enough-effect-descriptions-jeed\n[mr_jeed]: https://modrinth.com/mod/just-enough-effect-descriptions-jeed\n[cf_ie]: https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/immersive-engineering\n[mr_ie]: https://modrinth.com/mod/immersiveengineering\n[cf_mek]: https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mekanism\n[mr_mek]: https://modrinth.com/mod/mekanism\n[cf_lc]: https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/the-lost-cities\n[mr_lc]: https://modrinth.com/mod/the-lost-cities\n[cf_shimmer]: https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/shimmer\n[mr_shimmer]: https://modrinth.com/mod/shimmer",
